<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom says bought 9.4 mln shrs off-mkt.</title>
<headline>Telecom says bought 9.4 mln shrs off-mkt.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said on Wednesday it had bought 9.4 million shares offmarket between March 5 and March 18, in its $1 billion buyback programme.</p>
<p>It bought the shares at prices ranging from NZ$6.27398 to $6.7205.</p>
<p>The shares closed two cents stronger on Wednesday at NZ$6.37. -- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
